  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><b>Perfumed Body Cream with Cashmere Extract &amp; Collagen</b></p>\n<p><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/jasmine-sandal-04.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></strong></p>\n<p><b>The secret to beautiful, firm skin </b>is a regular and effective care routine.\\</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/jasmine-sandal-01(2).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>This incredible concentrated cream features <b>28 active ingredients</b> to deliver maximum nourishment and hydration.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/jasmine-sandal-02(2).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>The <b>cashmere formula</b> gently melts, applies effortlessly, and leaves the skin amazingly soft, hydrated, and luxuriously scented. Experience the true magic of beauty with BE TRENDY products.</p>\n<p><b>Cashmere Proteins</b>. The use of these proteins is based on their unique ability to stimulate collagen production and maintain skin elasticity. They form a thin protective barrier on the skin's surface that locks in moisture and deeply cares for your skin.</p>\n<p><b>Collagen.</b> As the fundamental protein for our skin, collagen boosts skin tone and maintains its elasticity. It helps even out skin tone, enhances complexion, and offers powerful regenerative properties.</p>\n<p><b>Allantoin.</b> Renowned for its multifaceted soothing and restorative properties, allantoin significantly enhances the quality of skincare products. It boosts skin smoothness and softens the texture, imparting a healthy glow.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-04(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>A <b>niche fragrance</b> of seduction and endless possibilities, enveloping you in a luxurious trail that lasts <b>all day</b>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/jasmine-sandal-03(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>The fragrance opens with a clean, almost translucent note of <b>jasmine</b>. <b>Lilies</b> and <b>freesia</b> step in to add depth and pure sophistication. The scent locks in its magic with a base of <b>sandalwood</b> and <b>amber</b>, subtly accompanying your every movement and every single moment.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-06(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n </div>\n</div>",
